# Repo-wide line-ending policy.
#
# The frozen CLI fixtures are compared byte-for-byte against CLI output, which
# uses LF. Git for Windows defaults to `core.autocrlf=true`, so without this any
# `windows-latest` checkout turned them into CRLF and the whole
# `cli-english-surface` suite failed on Windows only (EVO-G13 / G47 follow-up).
*.txt text eol=lf

# Source and docs stay LF in the repository as well.
*.ts text eol=lf
*.tsx text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
